<mxCell id="c19" value="Inside the model the link runs at the symbol rate; the wrapper meets your MAC or PHY at the PIPE. x1 Gen1 only: PIPEx1__pcieVHost.sv and RCPIPEx1__pcieVHost.sv. For Icarus, these x1 wrappers." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;badge=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="520" width="970" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
